cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below. Quote the generated_at date of the copy you used — rows change between exports."
type: dataset
title: "SelfHost Atlas install-verification dataset"
authors:
  - name: "SelfHost Atlas"
    website: "https://selfhostatlas.com"
license: CC-BY-4.0
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.22983606"
url: "https://selfhostatlas.com/how-we-test"
repository: "https://github.com/usualdesigner/selfhost-atlas-data"
abstract: >-
  Self-hostable applications whose published install instructions were run
  unmodified on a fresh cloud server, with the OS and date of each run, plus
  idle first-boot RAM and disk measured on a named machine for a subset.
  Documented minimum RAM is included and labelled as documented, not measured.
keywords:
  - self-hosted
  - docker
  - install verification
  - open data
